with status records and no \code{DIAG} or \code{DIAG_NEXTRAK} record is named in a
message; its \code{noise}, \code{pings} and \code{log_detections} are \code{NA}, and
\code{\link[=audit_listening]{audit_listening()}} reads its other status records. \code{DATA_ERROR} records
carry no time or serial, so they are not rows of the table; a message
counts them, and \code{attr(, "source")} gives the count per file.

